  "body": "In https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#process-a-navigate-response we end up redefining the type variable with a value of a different type. Perhaps we should rename the second variable to MIME type or name the original navigationType as it's called at a different point.\r\n\r\n@mikewest introduced this, but I think I reviewed it and didn't see it.",
